0.12 0.14 0.18 rg BT /F1 9.3 Tf 49 532 Td (Lunar exploration requires continuity of health observations even when access to Earth-based) Tj ET
0.12 0.14 0.18 rg BT /F1 9.3 Tf 49 518 Td (medical support is limited. VIGIL is an educational, local-first prototype designed to provide) Tj ET
