0.12 0.14 0.18 rg BT /F1 9.3 Tf 49 481 Td (The LUNA-01 story moves from Earth baselines \(days -6 to -1\) through transit in microgravity) Tj ET
0.12 0.14 0.18 rg BT /F1 9.3 Tf 49 467 Td (\(days 0 to 3\), landing \(day 4\) and lunar surface check-ins thereafter.) Tj ET
0.12 0.14 0.18 rg BT /F1 9.3 Tf 49 444 Td (Dashboards display fictional resting heart rate, heart-rate variability, sleep, exercise,) Tj ET
