0.12 0.14 0.18 rg BT /F1 9.3 Tf 49 351 Td (VIGIL provides simulated Doctor, Nurse, Pharmacist and Psychologist modes. These are) Tj ET
0.12 0.14 0.18 rg BT /F1 9.3 Tf 49 337 Td (educational support experiences, not licensed clinicians or autonomous healthcare providers.) Tj ET
0.12 0.14 0.18 rg BT /F1 9.3 Tf 49 314 Td (Doctor: helps inspect recorded observations and cited NASA reference excerpts. Nurse:) Tj ET
0.12 0.14 0.18 rg BT /F1 9.3 Tf 49 300 Td (supportive check-ins. Pharmacist: records questions for a human reviewer but does not prescribe) Tj ET
0.12 0.14 0.18 rg BT /F1 9.3 Tf 49 286 Td (or dose medicines. Psychologist: supportive discussion, not diagnosis or psychotherapy.) Tj ET
0.12 0.14 0.18 rg BT /F1 9.3 Tf 49 263 Td (Explicit confirmation, purpose-scoped user-reported memory, source governance, bounded) Tj ET
