0.12 0.14 0.18 rg BT /F1 9.3 Tf 49 142 Td (selection; SQLite FTS5 for NASA excerpt retrieval.) Tj ET
0.12 0.14 0.18 rg BT /F1 9.3 Tf 49 119 Td (All crew records are synthetic. Raw symptom narratives and encounters are excluded from) Tj ET
